// Reserved non-colliding IDs and constants for the expandable right-side Browser pane
// (Spec: docs/browser/desktop-browser-pane-spec.md §9.2; GitHub #14106).
// Phase 1 (page/browserpane.coax) builds directly on these IDs; --minimal builds
// load page/v1-stubs.coax instead so zero browser code or WebKit/CEF symbols ship.

